   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the UNDP Governance Programme 2008-2010 are to strengthen the democratic governance in Honduras and to promote sustainable human development. The programme include project support for reforms for the strengthening of democracy (including the elaboration and distribution of NHDR and MDG-reports) and support to work within the areas of security, justice and social cohesion.</narrative>
